advocacy of any other political viewpoint.  The closest thing I can find is
the "removal of political limits" in Boundless Expansion, and "fostering
personal responsibility, and individual liberty" in Spontaneous Order.

I realize that this topic is of great interest to Extropians (especially on
the List), and I have no problem with that.  However, I do resist referring
to it (or any other system) as the "official" Extropian political
viewpoint.  Alternatively, if it really *is* the official Extropian
viewpoint, then this should be made explicit, and anarcho-capitalism should
be unambiguously added to the Principles.

