While I agree that it is good for people to defend their liberty and think
for themselves, I have no interest in overwhelming them to do so.  I am in
favour of making Extropian information available to anyone who wishes to
access it, but I see little benefit of proselytization simply to increase
our ranks.  Focused effort on specific areas of research, in which
individuals with Extropian viewpoint are already involved, will be much
more rewarding than wholesale conversion of the masses.

